 "Stage 1: each of the two content tokens is a lookup code (8-dim table over the 113 tokens) - the position-0/1 embeddings are "
 "a token-code plus a constant position vector. Stage 2: attention mixes the two tokens; the last-position residual (resid_mid/attn_out) "
 "is additive in the two tokens: resid_mid = mean + ci(i) + cj(j) with 14-dim codes, so the two token identities are recoverable by nearest code. "
